  "body": "Looking for a brand-new, low-maintenance Freehold home in Orewa? These beautifully designed homes at 25 Mahinga Kai Road offer an excellent opportunity for first-home buyers, downsizers, investors or those looking for an easy-care lifestyle.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n* 3 spacious bedrooms\r\n* 2 bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n* Modern open-plan kitchen, dining and living \r\n* Quality Bosch appliances\r\n* Light-filled deck - great for outdoor entertaining\r\n* Single internal-access garage\r\n* Brand new and ready to move in\r\n* Excellent opportunity for first-home buyers or investors!\r\n* 10-year Stamford Warranty for your peace of mind\r\n\r\nPositioned in the growing Orewa/Hibiscus Coast community, you're close to local shops, cafés, schools, beaches, parks and recreational facilities, with easy access to the motorway and surrounding amenities.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private home tour or come to our open homes!\r\n\r\n*************How to find 25 Mahinga Kai Road***************\r\nSet GPS to 25 Mahinga Kai Road or access from Flavell Drive to Strathmill subdivision.",
